{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55590","headline":"偈 · 永安","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汝问西来意，且过遮（《五灯会元》作「这」）边立。\n昨夜三更时，雨打虚空湿。\n电影豁（《五灯会元》作「忽」）然明，不似蚰蜒急。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十六、《五灯会元》卷十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"永安","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}